  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5fa92c1ac281497086f905a3a552828e, type: 3}
  m_Name: CafeConversation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ConversationCutsceneAsset
  title: 
  nextSceneName: 
  defaultPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 90de8a25fb68de34eb030b5fda298349, type: 3}
  lines:
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Welcome to the cafe! The shift is not staffed yet, which means every future
      problem is still technically preventable.
    live2DTriggerName: Speak
    advanceMode: 0
    requiredSignalId: 
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 0
    startActions: []
    endActions: []
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Open the cafe bag, then drag subjects from the bag onto the assignment
      panels. Each panel represents one place someone can work.
    live2DTriggerName: Speak
    advanceMode: 0
    requiredSignalId: 
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 0
    startActions: []
    endActions: []
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: 
    live2DTriggerName: 
    advanceMode: 1
    requiredSignalId: cafe_assignment_made
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 1
    startActions:
    - actionType: 1
      targetId: cafe_bag
      signalId: 
      duration: 0
      clearPreviousHighlights: 0
    - actionType: 1
      targetId: assignment_panel
      signalId: 
      duration: 0
      clearPreviousHighlights: 0
    endActions:
    - actionType: 3
      targetId: 
      signalId: 
      duration: 0
      clearPreviousHighlights: 0
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: You can also open the schedule board. It shows the cafe positions in one
      place, which is usually easier than judging the shift by memory and vibes.
    live2DTriggerName: Speak
    advanceMode: 0
    requiredSignalId: 
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 0
    startActions: []
    endActions: []
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: 
    live2DTriggerName: 
    advanceMode: 1
    requiredSignalId: cafe_schedule_opened
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 1
    startActions:
    - actionType: 1
      targetId: schedule_button
      signalId: 
      duration: 0
      clearPreviousHighlights: 0
    endActions:
    - actionType: 3
      targetId: 
      signalId: 
      duration: 0
      clearPreviousHighlights: 0
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: 
    live2DTriggerName: 
    advanceMode: 1
    requiredSignalId: cafe_schedule_closed
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 1
    startActions: []
    endActions:
    - actionType: 3
      targetId: 
      signalId: 
      duration: 0
      clearPreviousHighlights: 0
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: When every position is set, click Submit! Then we can observe what your
      staffing decisions do under pressure.
    live2DTriggerName: Speak
    advanceMode: 0
    requiredSignalId: 
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 0
    startActions: []
    endActions: []
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Read the counter conversation.
    live2DTriggerName: 
    advanceMode: 1
    requiredSignalId: read_counter
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 1
    startActions: []
    endActions: []
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Read the bar conversation.
    live2DTriggerName: 
    advanceMode: 1
    requiredSignalId: read_bar
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 1
    startActions: []
    endActions: []
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Read the floor conversation.
    live2DTriggerName: 
    advanceMode: 1
    requiredSignalId: read_floor
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 1
    startActions: []
    endActions: []
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: So. You listened to all three little workplace incidents.
    live2DTriggerName: 
    advanceMode: 0
    requiredSignalId: 
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 0
    startActions: []
    endActions: []
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Now comes the useful part. Tell me which subjects should remain in their
      assigned positions.
    live2DTriggerName: 
    advanceMode: 0
    requiredSignalId: 
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 1
    startActions: []
    endActions: []
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Be honest. I will be professional about judging them. Probably.
    live2DTriggerName: 
    advanceMode: 0
    requiredSignalId: 
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 1
    startActions: []
    endActions: []
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: 
    live2DTriggerName: 
    advanceMode: 1
    requiredSignalId: retention_selection_submitted
    hideCanvasWhileWaitingForSignal: 1
    startActions:
    - actionType: 5
      targetId: 
      signalId: open_retention_selection
      duration: 0
      clearPreviousHighlights: 0
    endActions: []
  - speakerName: Clothos
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: EOF
    live2DTriggerName: 
